<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8590 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8590 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8590 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>					  June 9	     June 6</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8590	     1.8590</p>
<p> Volume traded			$11.53 million	 $2.94 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +380-44-244-9150</p>
</text>
